Name: ONNX Runtime
Short Name: onnxruntime
URL: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
Version: 1.31.0
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Microsoft's ONNX Runtime runs Tark's live caption models on the phone.
Tark for Android uses the official Android release from Maven Central,
com.microsoft.onnxruntime:onnxruntime-android:1.31.0 (AAR sha256
72683787a80d0608a3121b967d8e1239aef48286826661c953211626690540a7,
android/captions/ort.sh); its arm64 libonnxruntime.so is stored in the APK
and loaded at run time by the captions process. LICENSE and
ThirdPartyNotices.txt are the release's own.

Local Modifications:
None. Tark sets ORT_DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1 before loading the library and calls
DisableTelemetryEvents, so the release's telemetry stays off.
